== Description ==

'''Forged Copper''' is a refined metal ingot in ''[[Human Host]]'', crafted at the [[Furnace]]. It appears as an ingredient in 30 downstream recipes at 4 different workbenches, including [[Copper Alloy]], [[Transformer]], [[Iron Hammer]], [[Bullet Shell]], [[Copper Buckshot]], [[Copper Bullet Tip]], among others. See the ''Used in'' table for the full consumer list.

